  "extraction_notes": "DATB 8a, Catalyst 14, and Catalyst 15 are named but their structures are not drawn in the figure. Based on the literature (Nature Communications 2017, 8, 1450), 8a is tris(2,2,2-trifluoroethyl) borate, but only the label and name are provided here. The stereochemically pure product 39 is assumed to be the (S,S) dipeptide. EDCI yield is noted with a diastereomeric ratio. Catalyst 14 and 15 entries specify 'No conversion'. MS4A (molecular sieves 4A) is included as a reagent for 8a and 14 as per footnote a."
